    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d99-a2">

                <pb facs="0213" n="151" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg151"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 22.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Holcombe to Prince Kung.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-06-24"><hi rendition="#small-caps">June</hi> 24,
                        1878</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt of your Imperial Highness’s dispatch
                    of yesterday, covering copy of an imperial edict, by which Chung How, senior
                    vice-president of the board of civil office, is appointed to be His Majesty’s
                    envoy to Russia.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>CHESTER HOLCOMBE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
